    "name": "Candela: Colorless Dreams",
    "steam_appid": 2896610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/70d0f08884f7e083f4f0fd0d2bcbcd7a.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/70d0f08884f7e083f4f0fd0d2bcbcd7a.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring light to a colorless world in <i>Candela</i>, a mysterious and atmospheric puzzle platformer set in a desolate, post-apocalyptic land. Manipulate blue and red flames to solve puzzles, master challenging platforming, and uncover secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.mp4?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the powers of blue and red flames, combining them to unlock new possibilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a  non-linear world map, collecting keys and finding secrets to access new areas and progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging puzzles and a variety of mechanics that test your skills and creativity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a land full of mysteries waiting to be unraveled.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.mp4?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Every flame reveals a path, every color holds a secret, and every step brings you closer to illuminating the truth. Are you ready to reignite this dark world?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/70d0f08884f7e083f4f0fd0d2bcbcd7a.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/70d0f08884f7e083f4f0fd0d2bcbcd7a.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring light to a colorless world in <i>Candela</i>, a mysterious and atmospheric puzzle platformer set in a desolate, post-apocalyptic land. Manipulate blue and red flames to solve puzzles, master challenging platforming, and uncover secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/c36d807cecd2f99e57f872cd192db5a8.mp4?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the powers of blue and red flames, combining them to unlock new possibilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a  non-linear world map, collecting keys and finding secrets to access new areas and progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging puzzles and a variety of mechanics that test your skills and creativity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a land full of mysteries waiting to be unraveled.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.poster.avif?t=1750519620\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.webm?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896610/extras/a7c774b4d5ee5b7bc0df5d213284ca6b.mp4?t=1750519620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Every flame reveals a path, every color holds a secret, and every step brings you closer to illuminating the truth. Are you ready to reignite this dark world?</strong></p>",
